and the water stays."},{"role":"problem2","text":"But still water turns green with algae within a few days in warm weather."},{"role":"fix2","text":"So you add a pump and a sand filter on pipes to clean the water."},{"role":"name","text":"This is a pool filter, a pump and a sand tank joined by pipes."},{"role":"how","text":"The pump pulls water in through one pipe, and it pushes the clean water out through the other."},{"role":"fact","text":"Every pool passes its water through the filter about once every 6 to 8 hours, and the counter climbs to 8."},{"role":"congrats","text":"Congratulations, you have built a swimming pool."}]}